flowchart TD
  A[Client GET object, optional Range header] --> B{Auth + rate limit OK?}
  B -- no --> X[401 / 429]
  B -- yes --> C[Load object metadata from PostgreSQL]
  C --> D[Find chunks covering the byte range]
  D --> E{Bucket mode}
  E -- replication --> F[GET chunk from a live replica]
  F --> G[Node verifies SHA-256, 409 if corrupted]
  G --> H{R=2 replicas confirmed?}
  H -- no --> F
  H -- yes --> K[Return chunk bytes]
  E -- erasure coding --> I[GET any 4 of 6 shares from live nodes]
  I --> J[Reed-Solomon decode]
  J --> K
  K --> L[Stream bytes to client: 200 or 206 Partial Content]
